{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"calculateHMACSHA1","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"challenge","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"slot","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7YubiKit0A3OTPO","text":"YubiOTP","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7YubiKit0A3OTPO4SlotO","text":"Slot","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP\/Slot","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7YubiKit0A3OTPO","text":"YubiOTP","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7YubiKit0A3OTPO12StatusStreamV","text":"StatusStream","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP\/StatusStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"challenge","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The challenge. Padded to 64 bytes before transmission."}]}]},{"name":"slot","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The slot to challenge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A stream yielding progress and finally the 20-byte HMAC-SHA1 response.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the slot was programmed with ","type":"text"},{"code":"requireTouch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the YubiKey waits for a button press before","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answering. The returned stream reports that wait as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP\/Status\/waitingForUser(cancel:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" so a caller can prompt and offer to give up; when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no such feedback is needed, read ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP\/StatusStream\/value","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A touch-triggered slot only works over the OTP keyboard transport, which polls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the key — the pending touch shows up on every report, and the host can abort between polls.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Over SmartCard the YubiOTP application refuses the command outright with ","type":"text"},{"code":"0x6985","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"waiting, so the stream yields ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP\/Status\/finished(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" alone and cancellation does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing. Python and Java accept the same parameters on their SmartCard backends and likewise","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignore them.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is a limitation of the application, not of SmartCard: an application that defines a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"continuation on top of APDUs can report progress and be cancelled over the same transport.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CTAP2 does exactly that — it answers ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0x9100"},{"text":" and the host polls with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NFCCTAP_GETRESPONSE"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"which is how "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Status\/waitingForUser(cancel:)"},{"type":"text","text":" works over NFC. YubiOTP defines no such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exchange."}]}],"style":"important","type":"aside","name":"Important"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP\/Feature\/challengeResponse","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", available on YubiKey 2.2 or later."}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/YubiOTP\/Session\/calculateHMACSHA1(challenge:in:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"calculateHMACSHA1(challenge:in:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"extendedModule":"YubiKit","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"calculateHMACSHA1","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"challenge","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"}